        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Spiritual Clinic Simulator, you play as a young Taoist master who has inherited the family's ancient art of Sigil magic. You run a mysterious clinic dedicated to treating supernatural afflictions—from patients tormented by evil spirits to families seeking rituals to lay restless souls to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw powerful Sigil to combat vengeful entities, brew herbal remedies to cure mystical illnesses, and perform solemn rites to guide the dead. But beware: souls that fail to pass on may transform into malignant ghost or zombie. If you cannot defeat them before dawn, they will wreak havoc— costing you money, endangering your patients, and even threatening your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your clinic by growing medicinal herbs, crafting Sigil, and gathering ritual materials. Conduct seven-day ceremonies to purify buried souls and help them reincarnate peacefully. Earn income to repair and expand your clinic, purchase supplies, and hone your expertise in healing, exorcism, and soul guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you balance resources, face supernatural threats, and master the arts of life and death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiritual Clinic Simulator is a unique blend of management simulation, Eastern folk horror, and light combat set in a world steeped in supernatural tradition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《符医诡道》中，您将扮演一位继承了祖上符箓之术的年轻天师，经营一家专治“诡异邪病”的灵媒医馆。被邪祟缠身的患者们带着痛苦前来求治，也有枉死之人的家属请求您超度遗体。您需以笔墨绘符，或以草药熬汤，驱邪治病、超度亡魂。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但务必小心：未成功超度的亡者，以及附身鬼怪极为凶戾，可能怨气爆发成为凶灵或僵尸，若不能在天亮前将其消灭，不光让您损失钱财，也可能危及您与患者的性命。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每日经营中，您要种植药草、绘制符箓、应对各类诡异邪病，也要为超度仪式备齐材料，连续七日进行超度仪式直至灵魂安息，使其消除怨念转入轮回。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您的收入不但要修缮破败的医馆，也要购买经营所需耗材，画符煮药。维持医馆正常运作的同时，通过积累的经验提升自己，最终成为一名道法高深的天师，拯救诡异乱世，恢复家族荣光。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款融合了经营模拟、东方民俗恐怖与轻度战斗的独特游戏。您能否平衡资源、应对危机，并看透生死之间的秘密？</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Spiritual Clinic Simulator, you play as a young Taoist master who has inherited the family's ancient art of Sigil magic. You run a mysterious clinic dedicated to treating supernatural afflictions—from patients tormented by evil spirits to families seeking rituals to lay restless souls to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw powerful Sigil to combat vengeful entities, brew herbal remedies to cure mystical illnesses, and perform solemn rites to guide the dead. But beware: souls that fail to pass on may transform into malignant ghost or zombie. If you cannot defeat them before dawn, they will wreak havoc— costing you money, endangering your patients, and even threatening your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your clinic by growing medicinal herbs, crafting Sigil, and gathering ritual materials. Conduct seven-day ceremonies to purify buried souls and help them reincarnate peacefully. Earn income to repair and expand your clinic, purchase supplies, and hone your expertise in healing, exorcism, and soul guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you balance resources, face supernatural threats, and master the arts of life and death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiritual Clinic Simulator is a unique blend of management simulation, Eastern folk horror, and light combat set in a world steeped in supernatural tradition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《符医诡道》中，您将扮演一位继承了祖上符箓之术的年轻天师，经营一家专治“诡异邪病”的灵媒医馆。被邪祟缠身的患者们带着痛苦前来求治，也有枉死之人的家属请求您超度遗体。您需以笔墨绘符，或以草药熬汤，驱邪治病、超度亡魂。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但务必小心：未成功超度的亡者，以及附身鬼怪极为凶戾，可能怨气爆发成为凶灵或僵尸，若不能在天亮前将其消灭，不光让您损失钱财，也可能危及您与患者的性命。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每日经营中，您要种植药草、绘制符箓、应对各类诡异邪病，也要为超度仪式备齐材料，连续七日进行超度仪式直至灵魂安息，使其消除怨念转入轮回。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您的收入不但要修缮破败的医馆，也要购买经营所需耗材，画符煮药。维持医馆正常运作的同时，通过积累的经验提升自己，最终成为一名道法高深的天师，拯救诡异乱世，恢复家族荣光。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款融合了经营模拟、东方民俗恐怖与轻度战斗的独特游戏。您能否平衡资源、应对危机，并看透生死之间的秘密？</p>",
        "short_description": "This game combines Eastern folk horror with management simulation. By day, draw Sigil to treat patients and the over-deceased; by night, use these Sigil to combat malevolent spirits and zombies.",
